# Read by oxfmt (`vp fmt`) as its ignore file — there is no Prettier in the
# toolchain, but this filename is the ignore surface oxfmt honours (copied
# from the preferenceflow application). Generated Drizzle migrations — the pg
# package's fixture chain under tests/fixtures/migrations/ — are drizzle-kit's
# output and are never hand-formatted.
migrations/
# Changesets writes each package's CHANGELOG.md in the Release workflow's
# "Version Packages" PR, indenting every line of a multi-paragraph changeset,
# blank ones included; oxfmt would then fail that PR and trunk once it merges
# (effect-auth#546). The file is generated, never hand-edited.
CHANGELOG.md
